{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"feb08b9a448a6d8849ead791b305b99aa373ff61cc0aae0e1cd0cc54993789dc","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["飞卷的异象"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又举目观看，见有一飞行的书卷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他问我说：「你看见什么？」我回答说：「我看见一飞行的书卷，长二十肘，宽十肘。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他对我说：「这是发出行在遍地上的咒诅。凡偷窃的必按卷上这面的话除灭；凡起假誓的必按卷上那面的话除灭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["万军之耶和华说：我必使这书卷出去，进入偷窃人的家和指我名起假誓人的家，必常在他家里，连房屋带木石都毁灭了。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["量器中妇人的异象"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["与我说话的天使出来，对我说：「你要举目观看，见所出来的是什么？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我说：「这是什么呢？」他说：「这出来的是量器。」他又说：「这是恶人在遍地的形状。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["（我见有一片圆铅被举起来。）这坐在量器中的是个妇人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["天使说：「这是罪恶。」他就把妇人扔在量器中，将那片圆铅扔在量器的口上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我又举目观看，见有两个妇人出来，在她们翅膀中有风，飞得甚快，翅膀如同鹳鸟的翅膀。她们将量器抬起来，悬在天地中间。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我问与我说话的天使说：「她们要将量器抬到哪里去呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他对我说：「要往示拿地去，为它盖造房屋；等房屋齐备，就把它安置在自己的地方。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}